<p class="MsoNormal">Have
a good day,<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font size="4"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">{!User.Name}</span></font><br><br><font size="4" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="font-style: italic;"></span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"></span>{!User.Name}<br>{!User.Title}<br><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=CoolProspect">www.nationalfunding.com</a><br>P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}<br>Email: {!User.Email}<br><br><font color="#CC0000" size="1">Follow Us on:&nbsp;</font><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/national.funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNEu&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="http://www.linkedin.com/company/national-funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFn&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/NatFunding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFx&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a title="Google+" href="https://plus.google.com/+Nationalfunding/" target="_blank" alt="Google+"><img src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001Xf1W&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5&amp;lastMod=1363900191000"></a></p></div>]]></td>
